  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustain Sudan, market-based crisis response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aim to improve food security and agricultural resilience in Sudan. 

Outcomes: 
&#x2022;	Increased accessibility to agricultural inputs 
&#x2022;	Increased affordability of agricultural inputs 

Outputs
1.	Fertilizer supply secured and delivered
2.	Voucher system for smallholder farmers established
3.	Risk management mechanisms operationalized
4.	Partnership and capacity support to agro-dealers and local institutions
5.	Knowledge and learning generated</narrative>
  </description>
